insert into public.site_content (collection, slug, title, data, published, position)
values
('blogs','ai-in-ecommerce-product-discovery','How AI Can Improve Product Discovery in E-Commerce',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','A practical look at recommendations, conversational search, and the data and safeguards an online store should prepare.','content','AI can make a large catalogue easier to explore when it helps shoppers express what they need in natural language. Useful starting points include semantic search, related-product suggestions, and support that answers from current product details.

Start with clean catalogue attributes, transparent recommendation logic, and a way for shoppers to refine or dismiss suggestions. Measure useful outcomes such as successful searches and product engagement instead of claiming gains before a pilot. Keep checkout, pricing, and returns policies clear, and route uncertain questions to a person.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI for E-Commerce Product Discovery | ShreeG Solutions','seo_description','Explore practical AI product discovery for ecommerce, including conversational search, recommendations, data readiness, and responsible rollout.','seo_keywords','AI ecommerce development, AI product discovery, ecommerce product recommendations','aeo_question','How can AI improve product discovery in an online store?'),true,0),
('blogs','business-ai-finetuning-company-knowledge','Using Business Knowledge to Make AI Assistants More Useful',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','Learn how retrieval, evaluation, and fine-tuning can help an AI assistant respond in the context of a business.','content','A business AI assistant is only as useful as the information and boundaries behind it. First identify approved source material, owners, update frequency, and sensitive data. Retrieval-augmented generation can often connect a general model to current documents without changing the model weights; fine-tuning is better suited to consistent task patterns or output formats.

Evaluate with representative questions, expected answers, refusal cases, and human review. Track citation quality, freshness, and escalation behavior. Make it easy to report a wrong answer and update the source material.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','Business AI Assistants and Company Knowledge','seo_description','A practical guide to grounding business AI assistants in approved knowledge with evaluation, privacy, and human review.','seo_keywords','business AI assistant, AI fine-tuning for business, company knowledge AI','aeo_question','How can an AI assistant answer using my company information?'),true,1),
('blogs','ai-workflow-automation-business','AI Workflow Automation: Start with the Right Business Process',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','A simple framework for choosing routine workflows where AI assistance can save effort without removing needed oversight.','content','Good workflow automation begins with a repeated task, a clear input, and a measurable definition of done. Map the current steps, exceptions, approvals, and systems before choosing AI. Use deterministic rules for predictable decisions; use AI for unstructured text, classification, summarization, and drafting when errors can be reviewed.

Pilot on a narrow workflow, log decisions, protect sensitive information, and provide a manual path for exceptions. Compare time, quality, and rework against a baseline before expanding.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI Workflow Automation for Businesses','seo_description','Choose and pilot business AI automation with clear process mapping, human review, and measurable outcomes.','seo_keywords','AI workflow automation, business process automation with AI, AI business solutions','aeo_question','Which business workflows are suitable for AI automation?'),true,2),
('blogs','ai-digital-marketing-content-operations','AI in Digital Marketing: Better Research and Content Operations',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','Use AI to support audience research, content planning, and reporting while keeping strategy and final review with people.','content','AI can assist marketing teams with clustering search questions, outlining content, drafting variants, and summarizing campaign data. It does not replace audience understanding, factual review, brand judgment, or consent-aware measurement.

Build a workflow that records source evidence, checks claims, and has a person approve public content. Pair search engine optimization with answer-oriented content that gives direct, useful responses. Review performance over time and improve pages based on real user needs rather than keyword repetition.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI for Digital Marketing and Content Operations','seo_description','Ways to use AI for marketing research, content workflows, and reporting with quality review and useful SEO.','seo_keywords','AI digital marketing, AI SEO content, marketing automation tools','aeo_question','How can businesses use AI in digital marketing?'),true,3),
('blogs','ai-mobile-app-development-use-cases','Building Useful AI Features into Mobile Apps',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','From voice and image input to personalized assistance, choose mobile AI features based on user value and device constraints.','content','An AI feature belongs in a mobile app when it makes a user task clearer or faster. Common patterns include natural-language help, image understanding, speech transcription, personalized discovery, and intelligent form assistance. Consider connectivity, battery use, latency, accessibility, and the privacy implications of sending data to a service.

Prototype the full flow, including loading, uncertainty, failure, and human support states. Let users understand what the feature does and keep essential tasks available when the model is unavailable.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI Mobile App Development: Features and Considerations','seo_description','Plan mobile AI features around user needs, privacy, accessibility, reliability, and device constraints.','seo_keywords','AI mobile app development, AI features in apps, mobile app AI solutions','aeo_question','What are useful AI features for a mobile app?'),true,4),
('blogs','ai-software-product-development-lifecycle','The AI Software Product Development Lifecycle',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','A staged approach from problem discovery and data review through prototyping, evaluation, launch, and monitoring.','content','AI product development starts with a user problem, not a model choice. Define who benefits, how success will be measured, and when a non-AI solution may be simpler. Check data rights and quality, prototype the workflow, and test with realistic examples and edge cases.

Before launch, plan security, cost controls, observability, feedback, and a rollback path. After launch, monitor quality and drift, review user feedback, and improve the product deliberately. AI systems need ongoing product ownership just like other software.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI Software Product Development Lifecycle','seo_description','A step-by-step lifecycle for developing AI software products, from discovery and evaluation to monitoring.','seo_keywords','AI software product development, AI product engineering, custom AI software','aeo_question','What are the steps to develop an AI software product?'),true,5),
('blogs','ai-product-design-human-centered','Human-Centered Design for AI Products',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','Design AI interfaces that explain uncertainty, invite correction, and keep people in control of consequential decisions.','content','AI product design must account for uncertainty. Users need to know when a response is generated, what information it used, and how to correct it. Make confidence and limitations understandable without overwhelming the interface.

For consequential actions, provide review and confirmation. Design helpful empty, loading, and error states, and offer a non-AI route where appropriate. Test with the people who will use the product, including accessibility needs and varied levels of AI familiarity.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','Human-Centered AI Product Design','seo_description','Design AI product experiences with transparency, user control, accessible workflows, and correction paths.','seo_keywords','AI product design, human centered AI design, responsible AI UX','aeo_question','How should an AI product be designed for user trust?'),true,6),
('blogs','ai-customer-support-assistant-grounding','Designing a Grounded AI Customer Support Assistant',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','Use approved help content, clear escalation, and ongoing answer review to build a more dependable support assistant.','content','A customer support assistant should answer from approved, current help content and make its sources or next steps clear. Begin with common low-risk questions, map topics that need a human, and ensure the handoff includes relevant context.

Test policy questions, ambiguous phrasing, outdated information, and attempts to elicit unsupported answers. Track resolution quality and escalation, not just response speed. Keep help articles maintained and give support staff a way to flag gaps.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI Customer Support Assistant: Grounding and Handoffs','seo_description','Build a support AI assistant around current help content, quality testing, and smooth human escalation.','seo_keywords','AI customer support assistant, customer service chatbot AI, grounded support bot','aeo_question','How do you keep an AI customer support assistant accurate?'),true,7),
('blogs','ai-web-applications-business-integrations','AI Web Applications and Business System Integrations',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','Connect AI capabilities with existing business tools through secure, tested integrations and sensible permissions.','content','AI web applications often need to work with existing customer, inventory, document, or operations systems. Map the data flow and permissions first. Use least-privilege access, validate input and output, and record important actions for review.

Keep model calls behind a secure server, handle timeouts and rate limits, and avoid exposing secret keys in the browser. Start with read-only assistance, then add actions only with clear authorization and confirmation.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI Web Applications and Business Integrations','seo_description','Connect AI web applications with business systems using secure data flows, permissions, and confirmation steps.','seo_keywords','AI web application development, business AI integration, custom AI software development','aeo_question','How can AI be integrated with existing business software?'),true,8),
('blogs','choose-ai-or-rules-based-automation','When to Use AI and When to Use Rules-Based Automation',jsonb_build_object('excerpt','Choose the simplest reliable approach: rules for predictable tasks and AI for flexible work with measurable review.','content','Rules-based automation is usually a good fit when inputs and decisions are predictable and exact. AI can help when work involves varied language, documents, images, or patterns that are hard to enumerate. Many business solutions combine both: AI interprets a request, while rules enforce permissions and business constraints.

Compare error costs, review needs, latency, privacy, and maintenance. Use a small evaluation set and a human fallback before deployment. The goal is a dependable workflow, not AI for its own sake.','author','ShreeG Solutions','seo_title','AI vs Rules-Based Automation for Business','seo_description','Understand when to use AI, conventional automation, or a combination for reliable business software.','seo_keywords','AI vs automation, rules based automation, choosing AI for business','aeo_question','When should a business use AI instead of rules-based automation?'),true,9)
on conflict (collection,slug) do update set title=excluded.title,data=excluded.data,published=excluded.published,position=excluded.position,updated_at=now();

